# Beam me up costs {3}{W} (CR 118.9, 601.2f): on turn 3, with Mox Pearl tapped in upkeep, the four other Moxen
# can't cast it from the graveyard. On turn 5 Mox Pearl and three Moxen pay it exactly, Ornithopter returns to Bot1's hand,
# the search finds Rescue Skiff (a Spacecraft), and the spell is exiled. Two Rescue Skiffs keep one in the library
# whatever the turn-1 search's shuffle puts on top for the draws.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Federation Resupply
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Rescue Skiff x2
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Federation Resupply.Cast
Bot1.Search()
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Graveyard.Federation Resupply.Cast(Ability: Beam me up; Mana: short)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Graveyard.Federation Resupply.Cast(Ability: Beam me up)
Bot1.Choose(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Search(Rescue Skiff)

[Expect]
Exile = Federation Resupply
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter = (absent)
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Revealed = Rescue Skiff
